# generated simulation output
*.vcd

# Phase-1 benchmark designs — third-party RTL fetched for LOCAL measurement only.
# Never redistributed: not committed, not packaged. Each design keeps its upstream
# license in place under bench/<name>/. See docs/study/01-interpreted-vs-compiled.md.
/bench/*
# ...except this one: bench/keccak is OUR OWN RTL (see its README), and the doc-18
# round-26 three-tier measurement is only reproducible if it ships.
!/bench/keccak/
/bench/keccak/*.vvp
/bench/keccak/obj_dir*/
